sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CU as Customer
    participant CH as Messaging channel
    participant VO as Voice channel
    participant AG as AI Agent
    participant ME as Memory
    participant KB as Knowledge
    participant SR as System of record
    participant HD as Human desk
    participant IN as Insights

    rect rgb(235, 242, 255)
    Note over CU,ME: Beat 1 - Recognized cold open
    CU->>CH: First message
    CH->>AG: Inbound message
    AG->>ME: Look up profile by phone
    ME-->>AG: Name + prior interaction
    AG-->>CU: Greets by name, references prior interaction
    end

    rect rgb(235, 255, 240)
    Note over CU,KB: Beat 2 - Grounded answer
    CU->>AG: Factual question
    AG->>KB: Search top-k 3
    KB-->>AG: Relevant passages
    AG-->>CU: Answer with figures verbatim
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
    Note over CU,SR: Beat 3 - Wow moment
    CU->>AG: Requests the action
    AG-->>CU: Confirms details
    CU->>AG: Yes
    AG->>SR: Mutate record
    SR-->>AG: New state + reference id
    AG->>ME: Write observation, past tense, dated
    AG-->>CU: Result with reference id
    end

    rect rgb(245, 235, 255)
    Note over CU,VO: Beat 4 - Continuity moment
    AG-->>CU: Offers channel switch
    CU->>VO: Switches channel
    VO->>AG: Same conversation, new channel
    AG-->>CU: First turn references the Beat 3 action
    opt Escalation
    AG->>HD: Handoff with reason + context
    HD-->>CU: Human continues without re-asking
    end
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    Note over AG,IN: Beat 5 - Insight close
    AG->>IN: Conversation ended
    IN-->>IN: Summary, sentiment, adherence, custom score
    end
